.TH Num.percent 3 2026-08-27 "Tomo man-pages"
.SH NAME
Num.percent \- format as a percentage
.SH LIBRARY
Tomo Standard Library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.BI Num.percent\ :\ func(n:\ Num,\ precision:\ Num\ =\ 1%\ ->\ Text)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A number as a percentage, rounded to the given precision.


.SH ARGUMENTS

.TS
allbox;
lb lb lbx lb
l l l l.
Name	Type	Description	Default
n	Num	The number to format. 	-
precision	Num	Round the percentage to this precision. 	1%
.TE
.SH RETURN
The percentage, with a percent sign.

.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
assert (0.5).percent() == "50%"
assert (1./3.).percent() == "33%"
assert (1./3.).percent(0.01%) == "33.33%"
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Tomo-Num (3)
